---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="CricBreakdown's privacy policy.">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 md:px-8 pt-16 pb-24">
    <span class="stat-chip text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-leather">Legal</span>
    <h1 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl md:text-4xl text-pitch mt-2 mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none prose-headings:font-display prose-headings:text-pitch prose-a:text-leather">
      <p><em>Last updated: [insert date before publishing]</em></p>

      <p>
        CricBreakdown ("we," "us," or "this site") respects your privacy. This
        policy explains what information is collected when you visit and how
        it's used.
      </p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p>
        We do not require account creation or collect personal information
        directly. Standard web analytics (e.g. page views, approximate
        location, device/browser type) may be collected automatically to
        understand how the site is used.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
      <p>
        This site uses or intends to use Google AdSense to display
        advertising. Google and its partners may use cookies to serve ads
        based on your prior visits to this or other websites. You can opt out
        of personalized advertising by visiting
        <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based
        on a user's prior visits to this website or other websites. Google's
        use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads
        based on your visit to this site and/or other sites on the internet.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-party links</h2>
      <p>
        This site may link to external sites. We are not responsible for the
        privacy practices of those sites.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy can be sent to
        <a href="mailto:hello@cricbreakdown.com">hello@cricbreakdown.com</a>.
      </p>

      <p class="text-sm text-ink/40 mt-10">
        Note: this is a starting template, not legal advice. Review with a
        qualified professional before publishing, and update the contact
        email and date once your site is live.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
